## Core Product Vision

ExamDNA BD is an intelligent examination platform where teachers can create exams without manually writing questions, while students receive personalized practice based on their learning weaknesses.

Unlike basic quiz apps, ExamDNA BD must remember student mistakes, track concept-level mastery, analyze verified historical exam-question patterns, and recommend targeted practice.

The central product experience must be:

**Teacher selects a topic → AI analyzes relevant approved historical questions → Exam is generated → Teacher reviews → Students take the exam → AI analyzes mistakes → Students practice weak topics.**

